WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- It's been a couple years.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.624
So I heard that you have a grandson now.

00:00:02.624 --> 00:00:04.374
- I have my first grandchild.

00:00:04.374 --> 00:00:06.590
(audience applauding)
- [Kelly] How exciting.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.810
It's way more fun with grandkids, right?

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:09.947
- [Guest] Oh my God. I had no idea

00:00:09.947 --> 00:00:12.650
I had this much untapped
love inside of me.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.570
- [Kelly] Look at that face?

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.550
- And the cool thing was

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.650
my daughter got on Jerry Springer

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.070
and we were able to find
out who the father is

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.450
without--
(audience laughing)

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.121
Spending one dime of our own money.

00:00:23.121 --> 00:00:24.420
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.370
- cleared it right up.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.979
Wait, so is he gonna call
you something Southern

00:00:26.979 --> 00:00:28.610
like Papa or anything?

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.237
- All right. So years ago when I was doing

00:00:31.237 --> 00:00:32.630
"Are You Smarter Than a 5th Grader?"

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.810
I wrote three children's books.

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:35.700
And a friend of mine,

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.770
his little girl,

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.150
couldn't say my name.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.127
And so she would always go,

00:00:39.127 --> 00:00:42.427
"Dad, let's read the Jex Fox Worley book."

00:00:42.427 --> 00:00:43.543
(some laugh)

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.800
And, so when my kids heard that

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.220
they never called me dad again.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.080
They just called me Jex. J-E-X.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:48.913
And I thought, well--
- [Kelly] Which is cute.

00:00:48.913 --> 00:00:51.400
Little kids can say it,
that'll be my granddad name.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.930
I'll just be Jex.

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:54.470
Well, and my wife was Gaga

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.310
so my son-in-law's mom forgot our names

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.167
like a couple months in, and she said,

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:03.982
"So how is Gaga and Chex Mix doing?"

00:01:03.982 --> 00:01:05.770
(audience laughing)

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.130
And so, now my kids heard that
and that's all they call...

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.686
They call me Chex Mix.

00:01:10.686 --> 00:01:11.519
(audience laughing)

00:01:11.519 --> 00:01:14.020
So I'm gonna be the only
granddad in the world--

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:15.567
It's like, who would go,

00:01:15.567 --> 00:01:18.227
"Should I be Pringles?"

00:01:18.227 --> 00:01:19.387
- [Kelly] "Muddy buddies?"
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:19.387 --> 00:01:21.170
- "You know, I'll be Chex Mix"

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.003
- I like Chex Mix.

00:01:22.003 --> 00:01:23.900
So they call you Chex Mix?

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.400
Yeah. When I walk in

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.547
and then they have my
grandson, they're like,

00:01:26.547 --> 00:01:27.969
"Chex Mix!"

00:01:27.969 --> 00:01:29.226
(all laugh)

00:01:29.226 --> 00:01:30.221
(Kelly animates)

00:01:30.221 --> 00:01:31.332
Yeah.
- I love that.

